# Force LF line endings on every text file, regardless of a contributor's
# local git config (core.autocrlf) or editor — a VPS-side commit once
# converted the whole repo to CRLF because of exactly that, turning every
# file's diff into noise. Binary assets are left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
